MID_SV_Meal_Pet1_m03_01: I don't like it, but I'll eat all of it.
MID_SV_Meal_Pet1_m03_02: Can't...leave...anything...on...plate... Uwagh...
MID_SV_Meal_Hur_m03_01: The sooner I eat it...the sooner it'll be gone.
MID_SV_Meal_Hur_m03_02: I'd feel guilty about being too picky, but...
MID_SV_Meal_Max_m03_01: Uwagh... Oh, wow.
MID_SV_Meal_Max_m03_02: My mouth is in hell.
MID_SV_Meal_Jes_m03_01: Eeyagh! That is GROSS!
MID_SV_Meal_Jes_m03_02: And I thought I was good at torture!
MID_SV_Meal_Gol_m03_01: My tongue feels funny...
MID_SV_Meal_Gol_m03_02: Gotta... Hurk... Gotta get through it!
MID_SV_Meal_Gat_m03_01: I don't love the smell, but I will not waste food.
MID_SV_Meal_Gat_m03_02: It's fine. "He who disdains his provisions will—"\nGlrk—oh, gods.
MID_SV_Meal_Dan_m03_01: A true test of endurance.
MID_SV_Meal_Dan_m03_02: Ugh... What an...experience!
MID_SV_Meal_Fab_m03_01: Uck... I would dispose of this posthaste.
MID_SV_Meal_Fab_m03_02: Fodder fit only for the trough.
MID_SV_Meal_Esm_m03_01: Could be worse...could be better.
MID_SV_Meal_Esm_m03_02: I've been through worse!
MID_SV_Meal_Mic_m03_01: I may not like it, but I won't waste it.
MID_SV_Meal_Mic_m03_02: You should see what I've eaten on the battlefield.
MID_SV_Meal_Urs_m03_01: *gag* Well, at least it seems...um, nutritious.
MID_SV_Meal_Urs_m03_02: Oof... Not a single redeeming quality here...
MID_SV_Meal_Sim_m03_01: Oh, this stuff... Well, alright then.
MID_SV_Meal_Sim_m03_02: Blech... This is gonna be rough.
MID_SV_Meal_Lou_m03_01: C'mon, Lulu. Don't think about it and just eat it.
MID_SV_Meal_Lou_m03_02: Mrm... Maybe it won't taste so bad this time...
MID_SV_Meal_Fia_m03_01: Uch... Just one bite at a time...
MID_SV_Meal_Fia_m03_02: It's not my thing... But they went to all this trouble...
MID_SV_Meal_Die_m03_01: Urp. No. Can't take another bite.
MID_SV_Meal_Die_m03_02: This...won't keep me going.
MID_SV_Meal_Lor0_m03_01: B-better than nothing... Eugh.
MID_SV_Meal_Lor0_m03_02: I'll get it down...somehow.
MID_SV_Meal_Lor1_m03_01: I used to eat all sorts of things, surviving in\nback alleys...
MID_SV_Meal_Lor1_m03_02: It'd be rude if I couldn't get this down my\nthr—thr— *gag*
MID_SV_Meal_Set_m03_01: Food is sustenance. And for that, I am grateful.
MID_SV_Meal_Set_m03_02: I'm afraid to say, this isn't my favorite.
MID_SV_Meal_Nin_m03_01: I find this...beyond me.
MID_SV_Meal_Nin_m03_02: I...I just don't know where to begin.
MID_SV_Meal_Bon_m03_01: Eugh. Eughhh.
MID_SV_Meal_Bon_m03_02: Even at supper, I am beset by trials.
MID_SV_Meal_Tob_m03_01: Gotta wolf this down so I can go find some real food.
MID_SV_Meal_Tob_m03_02: Is this all that's on the menu?
MID_SV_Meal_Lil_m03_01: Not exactly tailored to my tastes.
MID_SV_Meal_Lil_m03_02: Gross. Is this some kind of joke?
MID_SV_Meal_Lys_m03_01: Just need to get through a few more bites... *gag*
MID_SV_Meal_Lys_m03_02: Food must not go to waste. Even this food.
MID_SV_Meal_Buc_m03_01: It's better than battlefield rations.
MID_SV_Meal_Buc_m03_02: Remember, you must eat to survive...
MID_SV_Meal_Sci_m03_01: Oh, this makes me feel...wretched.
MID_SV_Meal_Sci_m03_02: In a woman, eccentricities are charming. In food,\nthough...
MID_SV_Meal_Moo0_m03_01: Would be waaay tastier if it was more bitter.
MID_SV_Meal_Moo0_m03_02: Yuck. Get it over with...
MID_SV_Meal_Moo1_m03_01: Oh, I'm stuffed. Couldn't eat another thing...
MID_SV_Meal_Moo1_m03_02: Just got to stick it out and eat it...
MID_SV_Meal_Oly_m03_01: This is not quite to my taste, I must say.
MID_SV_Meal_Oly_m03_02: The flavor rather depresses me.
MID_SV_Meal_Naz_m03_01: Do I really gotta eat this?
MID_SV_Meal_Naz_m03_02: Blech! WAY too much spice!
MID_SV_Meal_Sar_m03_01: Well...I can eat it, if I must.
MID_SV_Meal_Sar_m03_02: I've suddenly lost my appetite.
MID_SV_Meal_Dai_m03_01: This is food? For real?
MID_SV_Meal_Dai_m03_02: Blech. Why did I order this?
MID_SV_Meal_Hal_m03_01: I think...this dish just isn't for me.
MID_SV_Meal_Hal_m03_02: Well, every meal is a blessing!
MID_SV_Meal_Guj_m03_01: My palate is very refined, you know. Godlike!\nAnd this...isn't great.
MID_SV_Meal_Guj_m03_02: Ugh, I can barely get it down.
MID_SV_Meal_Yan_m03_01: I must endure.
MID_SV_Meal_Yan_m03_02: To waste food would violate my principles.
MID_SV_Meal_Iio_m03_01: Just swallow without chewing.
MID_SV_Meal_Iio_m03_02: No choice but to eat it.
MID_SV_Meal_Pep_m03_01: It'd be a terrible shame to waste a meal. Even\nthis one...
MID_SV_Meal_Pep_m03_02: We wanted to experience other cultures. But\nthis dish...
MID_SV_Meal_Noc_m03_01: I've never eaten anything like this before. I don't\nmean that in a good way.
MID_SV_Meal_Noc_m03_02: How do you even make something taste like this?
MID_SV_Meal_Sop_m03_01: Good enough—long as it fills your belly.
MID_SV_Meal_Sop_m03_02: Flavor doesn't matter much. Not when you're\njust plain hungry.
MID_SV_Meal_Cat_m03_01: My apologies, but I find this disagreeable.
MID_SV_Meal_Cat_m03_02: A true knight faces every challenge!
MID_SV_Meal_Ned_m03_01: I hesitate to complain, and yet...
MID_SV_Meal_Ned_m03_02: It may not taste good, but at least it is nutritious.
MID_SV_Meal_Zac_m03_01: Forget this! Gimme somethin' good!
MID_SV_Meal_Zac_m03_02: Bandits cook better than this.
MID_SV_Meal_Maj_m03_01: Whoa, gross. Better wolf this down whole.
MID_SV_Meal_Maj_m03_02: Better'n prison food.
MID_SV_Meal_Ven_m03_01: Totally disgusting! What is this?!
MID_SV_Meal_Ven_m03_02: At my age, I deserve respect—not this slop!
MID_SV_Meal_Ini_m03_01: I'll finish. Persevere, Inyoni!
MID_SV_Meal_Ini_m03_02: I need to eat every bite, however long it takes.
MID_SV_Meal_Jas_m03_01: This is an uphill battle.
MID_SV_Meal_Jas_m03_02: This tastes awful. And now I feel awful.
MID_SV_Meal_Ale_m03_01: Oof... Buckle down and shovel it in.
MID_SV_Meal_Ale_m03_02: Somebody made this. I won't waste it.
MID_SV_Meal_Cle_m03_01: 
MID_SV_Meal_Cle_m03_02: 
MID_SV_Meal_Mys_m03_01: 
MID_SV_Meal_Mys_m03_02: 
MID_SV_Meal_Nat_m03_01: It's bad manners not to clean your plate.
MID_SV_Meal_Nat_m03_02: If swallowing this food is a test, I'm determined\nto pass.
MID_SV_Meal_Hri_m03_01: There's no getting around how bad this is.
MID_SV_Meal_Hri_m03_02: Is there water? I need to rinse out my mouth.
MID_SV_Meal_Tro_m03_01: Do people like this? I suppose it takes all kinds.
MID_SV_Meal_Tro_m03_02: At least I know I won't overeat.
MID_SV_Meal_Cen_m03_01: Mmph... It is my duty. I will leave no food behind.
MID_SV_Meal_Cen_m03_02: I suppose it is sustenance for the body and soul.
MID_SV_Meal_Asw_m03_01: It's not proper to leave food on one's plate.
MID_SV_Meal_Asw_m03_02: Me? No! Really, it's fine...
MID_SV_Meal_Kou_m03_01: What happened in the kitchen to produce this?
MID_SV_Meal_Kou_m03_02: It's...not the worst thing I've eaten to survive.
MID_SV_Meal_Nuz_m03_01: Hrk... Pain is a poor seasoning.
MID_SV_Meal_Nuz_m03_02: We mustn't...urp...waste food.
MID_SV_Meal_Kir_m03_01: At least it ain't rotten.
MID_SV_Meal_Kir_m03_02: *cough* I can't... I just can't...
MID_SV_Meal_Anh_Sci_m01_01: The winds appear to be in my favor, that I may dine\nwith you while this tempest rages in my heart!
MID_SV_Meal_Anh_Sci_m01_02: It was coincidence, not the wind. A simple divination\nwould confirm it.
MID_SV_Meal_Anh_Yan_m01_01: This repast is truly delicious! I could keep on\neating and drinking and never get enough!
MID_SV_Meal_Anh_Yan_m01_02: Eating and drinking to excess seems odd for a man\nin your profession.
MID_SV_Meal_Esm_Jes_m01_01: Heh heh HEH. Gonna make believe this is my\nenemies and slice it to bits...
MID_SV_Meal_Esm_Jes_m01_02: Why put it like that? Just admit you think it\ntastes good!
MID_SV_Meal_Orh_Die_m01_01: I'm happy to see you eating so much, Diego.
MID_SV_Meal_Orh_Die_m01_02: It's...hard to focus on chewing when you stare.\nBut I'll keep eating if it makes you happy.
MID_SV_Meal_Orh_Maj_m01_01: Oh! You can really eat! I bet you weren't a picky\neater as a child, were you?
MID_SV_Meal_Orh_Maj_m01_02: Nope! I'll eat anything, no matter how nasty. Never\ncould be too choosy.
MID_SV_Meal_Kai1_Ale_m01_01: Everything's so delicious. Huh? Alexandra, aren't\nyou going to eat?
MID_SV_Meal_Kai1_Ale_m01_02: Of course! I just got caught up watching you eat.\nYou're really enjoying it, aren't you?
MID_SV_Meal_Kai1_Hur_m01_01: Hehe! Yeah, you really dig into it, don't you?
MID_SV_Meal_Kai1_Hur_m01_02: That's because everything tastes better when you're\nsharing a meal with friends.
MID_SV_Meal_Gat_Urs_m01_01: In spite of my years, I still have all my teeth.\nI age more slowly than others.
MID_SV_Meal_Gat_Urs_m01_02: Thanks to that, we can enjoy all kinds of dishes,\ncan't we?
MID_SV_Meal_Gat_Dan_m01_01: I feel like I'm sharing a meal with a tree. Your eating\nposture is so—stiff! Should I match it?
MID_SV_Meal_Gat_Dan_m01_02: You might at least consider slouching less. Bad for\ndigestion.
MID_SV_Meal_Gol_Gat_m01_01: *chomp* Mm! *gulp* Man, this is TASTY! Hey—\nwhat you looking at me for? Eat!
MID_SV_Meal_Gol_Gat_m01_02: Oh, I just like seeing you enjoy it.
MID_SV_Meal_Gol_Lor0_m01_01: Whoa! You can really put it away! I've gotta take\nBIG bites to keep up with you!
MID_SV_Meal_Gol_Lor0_m01_02: Kid, I don't know if you noticed, but we got\ndifferent-sized mouths! Wannabes...
MID_SV_Meal_Sar_Dai_m01_01: Already full, Dadao? I would have thought you'd be\nback for seconds and thirds.
MID_SV_Meal_Sar_Dai_m01_02: You're the one with the bottomless stomach here.\nBut I'm no slouch! I can eat plenty more!
MID_SV_Meal_Jes_Dan_m01_01: Oh no, that won't do. You're supposed to be reveling\nin the taste, as if it's blood. Revel! Revel for me!
MID_SV_Meal_Jes_Dan_m01_02: Heh heh HEH! Playing director while I eat! How\n'bout I have your tongue for a snack?
MID_SV_Meal_Sim_Lou_m01_01: Simon, you mind holding off on the war stories?\nI think it's making me queasy.
MID_SV_Meal_Sim_Lou_m01_02: Sorry, sorry! Probably not what a proper lady wants\nto hear about while eating.
MID_SV_Meal_Sci_Oly_m01_01: You eat exquisitely, Blue Rose of Caelus. Is that\neven you, or is it a gorgeous flower at our table?
MID_SV_Meal_Sci_Oly_m01_02: Ohoho! At all times, I am at pains to be in the\nfullness of bloom!
MID_SV_Meal_Set_Nin_m01_01: Familiar flavors are comfortable. But foreign\ncuisines can be utterly fascinating.
MID_SV_Meal_Set_Nin_m01_02: I have been so long immersed in temple life\nthat most dishes are fascinating to me.
MID_SV_Meal_Dai_Hal_m01_01: This is SO good! Go on, Halvin, have some more!\n*chomp* *chomp* *cough*
MID_SV_Meal_Dai_Hal_m01_02: A-are you OK? Is something stuck in your throat?
MID_SV_Meal_Tal_Kir_m01_01: You scurvy devil... May your food crawl with worms.\nMay you lose your fortune! May you sink into filth!
MID_SV_Meal_Tal_Kir_m01_02: Have some damn class, you scumbag. Either eat,\nor keep your mouth shut.
MID_SV_Meal_Tal_Fia_m01_01: I'm so glad we could eat together, Talimun... I wish\nwe could stay like this forever.
MID_SV_Meal_Tal_Fia_m01_02: Forever's a tall order, even for me. But if a moment\nsharing a meal with you is all I can get...I'll take it.
MID_SV_Meal_Dan_Sci_m01_01: If you were to seduce someone over this meal,\nhow would you do it? Compare it to their skin, or...
MID_SV_Meal_Dan_Sci_m01_02: Dante, the fiery wind of your passion could melt\na glacier. Would that it blew in my direction!
MID_SV_Meal_Tia1_Pet1_m01_01: Peter, you always eat so fast. It's a wonder you never\nget an upset stomach.
MID_SV_Meal_Tia1_Pet1_m01_02: I guess I should slow down and enjoy it more, but I\njust can't help myself. Hehe.
MID_SV_Meal_Tia1_Bon_m01_01: I'm very much enjoying the lectures, but maybe you\nshould eat something, Bonaventure.
MID_SV_Meal_Tia1_Bon_m01_02: Ah, what has become of my manners? We are here\nfor dinner, not for discourse.
MID_SV_Meal_Dit_Cat_m01_01: Tell me, what do you like? Dislike? Then I'll tell\nyou mine!
MID_SV_Meal_Dit_Cat_m01_02: What need have you to know? Do not disturb\nthe meal.
MID_SV_Meal_Die_Lor0_m01_01: Diego! Isn't this yum? Eat it up!
MID_SV_Meal_Die_Lor0_m01_02: I was going to save it for later, but uh...\nOh, it is yum.
MID_SV_Meal_Tob_Oly_m01_01: You eat like a bird. You can pack more in when\nyou shovel it down!
MID_SV_Meal_Tob_Oly_m01_02: The speed of the eating affects the flavor? Well,\neither way, I would never be so vulgar!
MID_SV_Meal_Naz_Sar_m01_01: Hehe. We never get to eat this stuff back home.\nYou should have some, Sha Lan. It's great!
MID_SV_Meal_Naz_Sar_m01_02: Um, Nezha, you have to chew between bites...
MID_SV_Meal_Naz_Hal_m01_01: Wow, you can really pack it away. Going through a\ngrowth spurt, huh?
MID_SV_Meal_Naz_Hal_m01_02: Nope. This body's never gonna grow another—\nuh, ignore me. Let's dig in!
MID_SV_Meal_Nin_Noc_m01_01: I was...drawn to this particular dish. Is it possible\nthat you, too, can hear the spirits around us?
MID_SV_Meal_Nin_Noc_m01_02: Uh, not so far as I'm aware. But I'd be happy to share\na meal.
MID_SV_Meal_Buc_Moo0_m01_01: Hm. You have so little on your plate. You need more\nnutrients to get stronger.
MID_SV_Meal_Buc_Moo0_m01_02: But I'm so full... OK, sure. I'll go see if I can\nget seconds.
MID_SV_Meal_Pet0_Hur_m01_01: Just make sure you chew everything.
MID_SV_Meal_Pet0_Hur_m01_02: When it's tasty, I just gulp it down. Mom gets on my\ncase for that too.
MID_SV_Meal_Fia_Cen_m01_01: Are you eating properly? I don't know if you're\ngetting enough nourishment.
MID_SV_Meal_Fia_Cen_m01_02: I am, I promise. Everyone is watching over me just\nhow you hoped.
MID_SV_Meal_Bel_Asw_m01_01: Heehee. You know, I used to sneak my leftovers\nonto your plate while you weren't looking.
MID_SV_Meal_Bel_Asw_m01_02: Yes—my portions of food kept increasing, while you\ngiggled to the side. I noticed.
MID_SV_Meal_Bel_Max_m01_01: It's nice, enjoying a meal as myself. Not having to\nkeep my guard up.
MID_SV_Meal_Bel_Max_m01_02: I like it too. Someday, we'll share a meal like this to\ncelebrate the end of the war.
MID_SV_Meal_Bon_Lys_m01_01: I'm sorry to steal you away from your duties, but I\nrelish any chance to share a meal together.
MID_SV_Meal_Bon_Lys_m01_02: I see now the winning smile which must set the\nmaidens' hearts aflutter.
MID_SV_Meal_Mic_Moo1_m01_01: Would you please not butt in while I'm eating?\nY'know, I'm not a kid anymore.
MID_SV_Meal_Mic_Moo1_m01_02: Well, you still eat like one! Don't be so picky, Mu.
MID_SV_Meal_Lil_Lys_m01_01: There are a number of things I felt we should\ndiscuss over a meal. Where shall we begin?
MID_SV_Meal_Lil_Lys_m01_02: What did I let myself in for? Oh, well. At least I get\nfood out of it.
MID_SV_Meal_Lou_Buc_m01_01: Always a pleasure, Buccar! I gotta say, your table\nmanners are even better than mine!
MID_SV_Meal_Lou_Buc_m01_02: Of course. A retainer with crude manners can only\nembarrass his liege.
MID_SV_Meal_Led_Asw_m01_01: I've been learning to eat more like the commonfolk.\nI'll show you sometime.
MID_SV_Meal_Led_Asw_m01_02: I know you were in hiding back when we met, but...\nWhy are you pretending to be a commoner now?
MID_SV_Meal_Led_Moo0_m01_01: What are you staring for? Come on, hurry up and eat\nyour food.
MID_SV_Meal_Led_Moo0_m01_02: Ehe... I'm just admiring how you eat! It's so elegant.
MID_SV_Meal_Lor0_Set_m01_01: Loretta, the purpose of a dining utensil is to\nintroduce grace to the act of eating.
MID_SV_Meal_Lor0_Set_m01_02: Seteth... Come on. Let's just eat.